{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The borders of the empire have been invaded, and many places have fallen, and the speed is getting faster and faster...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is running out, warriors, move forward bravely, drive out the invading enemies and liberate our homeland. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customized appearance<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684570/extras/\u52a8\u753b1_english.gif?t=1745832645\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rich equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684570/extras/\u52a8\u753b2_english.gif?t=1745832645\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique attack model system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Configure the weapons and gems you collected to the attack model to change the skills and make you more powerful</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Configure different weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684570/extras/\u52a8\u753b3_english.gif?t=1745832645\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inlay gems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684570/extras/\u52a8\u753b5_english.gif?t=1745832645\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Freely choose the tower climbing map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684570/extras/\u52a8\u753b6_english.gif?t=1745832645\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomly generated map, you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attack enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit merchants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit blacksmiths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig for gems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open treasure chests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the unknown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All of the above are up to you to choose</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Plan your time reasonably, strengthen your character before the time is up, and finally challenge the BOSS level! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo version includes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable appearance (face pinching), changing clothes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 playable professions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 large map, free to plan your route</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684570?t=1745832645","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684570/aaf0104b00fa88b0f0e2d4ae90b25c3457dd2763/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745832645","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684570/abb7c514806eeba7b0d4fa846e2b82837cab148d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745832645","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684570/abb7c514806eeba7b0d4fa846e2b82837cab148d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745832645","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The borders of the empire have been invaded, and many places have fallen, and the speed is getting faster and faster...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is running out, warriors, move forward bravely, drive out the invading enemies and liberate our homeland. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customized appearance<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684570/extras/\u52a8\u753b1_english.gif?t=1745832645\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rich equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it